\p
\v 10 Then Yehoshua¦99251 instructed¦99250 the leaders of¦99254 the people¦99255,
\v 11 “Go¦99281 right through the camp¦99261 and tell the people¦99265: Get¦99279 everything ready that you'll all need because¦99270 in¦99260 three¦99273 days¦99274 we'll be ready to cross¦99276 over¦99276 this¦99280 river and enter the land¦99285 that your god¦99288 Yahweh¦99287 is¦99289 about¦99289 to give¦99289 to you, and to take¦99282 control of¦99291 it¦99291.”
\p
\v 12 To¦99294 the descendants of Reuben and Gad, and to¦99296 the half-tribe of Menashsheh¦99298, Yehoshua¦99300 said¦99299,\x + \xo 1:12-15: \xt Num 32:28-32; Deu 3:18-20; Josh 22:1-6.\x*
\v 13 “Remember¦99303 what Yahweh's¦99313 servant¦99311 Mosheh¦99310 informed you: Your god¦99316 Yahweh is¦99317 about¦99311 give this¦99324 land¦99323 to you and¦99319 to \add ≈enable you all to settle down\add*.
\v 14 Your women and children and your livestock¦99328 will¦99329 stay \add here\add* in¦99335 the land that¦99331 Mosheh¦99334 \add ≈allocated\add* to¦99333 you on¦99335 \add ≈this eastern\add* side¦99335 of the Yordan¦99336 River. But¦99328 your \add soldiers\add* must¦99329 dress for¦99339 battle¦99339 and cross¦99338 over¦99338 ahead of your brothers¦99341 and help¦99345 them¦99346
\v 15 until¦99348 Yahweh enables your brothers¦99354 to \add ≈take over the land that¦99363 your god¦99366 Yahweh is¦99367 about¦99367 to give¦99367 them¦99368 so they¦99356 can settle like¦99355 you all have\add*. Then you'll all be able to return¦99369 to this land which¦99363 Yahweh's¦99352 servant¦99379 Mosheh¦99378 gave¦99376 you on¦99381 \add ≈this eastern side¦99381 of the Yordan¦99382 and¦99372 take full control of it¦99373\add*.”
\p
\v 16 “We'll¦99389 do¦99395 everything¦99398 you've¦99394 told¦99394 us to¦99396,” the people answered¦99386, “and¦99396 we'll¦99395 go¦99402 wherever¦99400 you send¦99401 us.
\v 17 We'll listen¦99412 to you just like we¦99407 listened¦99407 to everything¦99404 Mosheh said. May¦99415 your¦99417 god¦99417 Yahweh¦99416 be¦99415 with you, just like he¦99420 was¦99420 with Mosheh.
\v 18 We'll put¦99444 anyone to death¦99444 who¦99428 rebels¦99430 against¦99430 your words¦99439 or refuses to follow your instructions. Just stay strong¦99446 and¦99447 courageous¦99447.”
\c 2
