\v 1 Then from¦99456 \add there at\add* \add ≈Acacia Grove\add*, Yehoshua¦99451 (Nun's¦99455 son¦99453) secretly¦99463 sent¦99450 off two¦99459 spies¦99462, saying¦99464, “Go¦99465 \add ≈and learn about¦99453 the land¦99469 over there, especially around\add* Yeriho¦99472 \add !(Jericho¦99472) City¦99472\add*.” \add ≈So¦99472\add* they went¦99473 off, and \add over there,\add* they entered the house¦99475 of¦99475 a woman¦99477—a prostitute¦99478 named Rahab¦99480—and they lay¦99481 down¦99481 there.\x + \xo 2:1: \xt Heb 11:31; Jam 2:25.\x*
\v 2 \add ≈However, someone told¦99485\add* Yeriho's¦99487 king¦99486, “Listen, some Israeli¦99495 men¦99490 arrived here¦99489 tonight to¦99496 \add ≈check out¦99496 our\add* land¦99499.”
