\v 15 Then¦99751 she put a rope¦99752 out through¦99753 the window¦99754 to let¦99751 them¦99751 down¦99751 \add to escape from the city\add*, because¦99755 her¦99756 house¦99756 where she lived was¦99757 \add actually built into\add* the side of¦99757 the wall¦99757.
