\v 17 “\add ≈This¦99789 promise that¦99790 you made¦99791 us¦99791 make\add*,” the¦99785 men¦99785 told her¦99784, “\add ≈won't apply unless you do this¦99789\add*:
\v 18 \add Take\add* this red cord¦99799 \add and\add* when we¦99794 \add ≈invade\add* the land, tie \add *it¦99807\add* in this window¦99804 \add ≈in the wall\add*. Make sure that¦99805 your parents¦99813 and your siblings and their households¦99820 are¦99795 all¦99818 here¦99793 in your house¦99824.
