\p
\v 10 In¦101018 the evening¦101028 of¦101016 \add ≈the fourth day¦101026 that the people¦101016 had been camped¦101015\add* at¦101019 Gilgal¦101019 there on¦101019 the plains¦101029 near Yeriho¦101030 \add !(Jericho¦101030)\add*, they¦101020 celebrated the ‘pass-over’.\x + \xo 5:10: \xt Exo 12:1-13.\x*
\s1 Eating from the land—no more manna
