\p
\v 11 The¦101033 next¦101035 day they ate roasted¦101038 grain¦101038 that \add they'd taken from that area\add*, and¦101032 ate flat bread¦101037 that same day.
\v 12 The¦101054 day¦101045 after¦101045 they'd eaten some¦101047 of¦101053 the produce from that area, there was no manna¦101055 \add on the ground to be collected\add* and¦101043 \add so\add* it¦101043 stopped—instead they'd eat the produce from the Canaan¦101059 region¦101058 \add beginning\add* that year¦101060.\x + \xo 5:12: \xt Exo 16:35.\x*
\s1 Yehoshua and the man with a sword
\rem /s1 The Lord's Commander Confronts Joshua; Joshua and the Man with a Sword; The Fall of Jericho; Joshua's Vision
