\v 1 \add ≈There were several kings¦103090 who¦103091 ruled in regions on¦103092 this west side¦103092 of the Yordan¦103093—the Hittites¦103104 and Amorites¦103105, the Canaanites¦103106 and Perizzites¦103107, the Hivites¦103108 and the Yebusites¦103109. Some were in the hill country¦103094, some in the lowlands¦103095, and some along the Mediterranean coast¦103097 south of Lebanon¦103103\add*. \add When\add* \add *they\add* heard¦103087 about¦103088 \add @what had happened at¦103092 Ay\add*,
