\s4 Promised land
\p
\v 15 This was the land that Mosheh¦105634 gave¦105633 to the tribe¦105635 of¦105636 Reuben¦105638, according to their¦105639 clans¦105639:
\v 16 The¦105643 area from¦105644 Aroer¦105644 (on¦105646 the edge¦105648 of the Arnon¦105651 riverbed¦105650) along to the town¦105652 in¦105654 the middle¦105654 of the valley¦105656, \add ≈to\add* the plateau¦105659 \add ≈near\add* Medeba¦105662,
\v 17 Heshbon and¦105665 all¦105665 it's cities¦105667 on¦105669 the plateau¦105669, \add including\add* Dibon¦105670, Bamot¦105671-Baal, Beyt¦105673-Baal-Meon,
\v 18 Yahaz, Kedemot¦105678, Mefaat,
\v 19 Kiriathaim, Sibmah¦105682, and¦105681 Zeret¦105683-Shahar on¦105685 the hill¦105685 \add ≈within\add* the valley¦105686.
