\p
\v 32 This was¦105900 the land that¦105900 Mosheh¦105903 gave¦105902 as¦105902 an inheritance in¦105904 the plains¦105904 of Moab¦105905 on¦105904 the eastern¦105909 side¦105906 of the Yordan¦105907 \add River opposite\add* Yeriho¦105908 \add !(Jericho¦105908)\add*.
\v 33 \add ≈However,\add* Mosheh¦105917 didn't¦105914 give¦105916 any inheritance \add of land\add* to¦105926 Levi's¦105913 descendants \add because\add* Yisrael's¦105921 god¦105920 Yahweh¦105919 is¦105923 their¦105923 inheritance just¦105924 as¦105924 he¦105925 told them.\x + \xo 13:33: \xt Num 18:20; Deu 18:2.\x*
\c 14
