\v 1 Then¦110877 Yehoshua¦110867 assembled all¦110870 the¦110872 tribes¦110872 of¦110872 Yisrael¦110873 at Shekem¦110874. He¦110875 summoned their elders¦110876, leaders, judges¦110879, and officers¦110880, and they¦110881 presented¦110881 themselves¦110881 before¦110882 God¦110883,
